  grh-ln "      <h3><span class='ep' data-pure='Binomial Power-Sum Continuation &amp; Exterior Trivial Zero Locus' data-wb='Akiyama&ndash;Tanigawa Bernoulli Numbers &amp; Riemann Zeta Continuation &zeta;(&minus;n)'>Binomial Power-Sum Continuation &amp; Exterior Trivial Zero Locus</span></h3>" (
  grh-ln "      <p>Before constraining zeros inside the critical strip <span class='m'>0 &lt; &Re;(<i>s</i>) &lt; 1</span>, continuation across <span class='m'>&Re;(<i>s</i>) = 1</span> fixes all exterior zeros. Defining the <span class='ep' data-pure='binomial power-sum rational sequence' data-wb='Bernoulli numbers'>binomial power-sum rational sequence</span> <span class='m'><i>B</i><sub><i>m</i></sub> &isin; &Qopf;</span> by exact triangular recurrence from <span class='m'><i>B</i><sub>0</sub> = 1</span> determines the negative-integer values <span class='m'><i>L</i>(0,1) = &minus;1/2</span>, <span class='m'><i>L</i>(&minus;1,1) = &minus;1/12</span>, <span class='m'><i>L</i>(&minus;3,1) = 1/120</span>, and <span class='m'><i>L</i>(&minus;5,1) = &minus;1/252</span>.</p>" (
  grh-ln "      <p>Because odd indices above 1 vanish identically, <span class='m'><i>L</i>(&minus;2<i>k</i>, 1) = 0</span> accounts for all zeros in <span class='m'>&Re;(<i>s</i>) &le; 0</span>, confining every remaining zero to <span class='m'>0 &lt; &Re;(<i>s</i>) &lt; 1</span> symmetrically under <span class='m'><i>s</i> &harr; 1 &minus; <i>s</i></span>.</p>" (
  grh-ln "      <div class='eq'>&sum;<sub><i>j</i>=0</sub><sup><i>m</i></sup> C(<i>m</i>+1, <i>j</i>) <i>B</i><sub><i>j</i></sub> = 0, &emsp; <i>L</i>(&minus;<i>n</i>, 1) = &minus;<i>B</i><sub><i>n</i>+1</sub> / (<i>n</i> + 1), &emsp; <i>L</i>(&minus;2<i>k</i>, 1) = 0 &ensp;(<i>k</i> &ge; 1)</div>" (
