  grh-ln "        <textarea class='code-ed' id='ed-02' spellcheck='false'>rz-gcd-go : Nat → Word → Word → Word&#10;rz-gcd-go zero a _ = if %weq a #0 then #1 else a&#10;rz-gcd-go (suc k) a b = if %weq b #0 then (if %weq a #0 then #1 else a) else rz-gcd-go k b (%wmod a b)&#10;data RQ : Type where&#10;  rq : (num : RZ) (den : Word) → RQ&#10;rq-mk : RZ → Word → RQ&#10;rq-mk (rz s m) d = let dd = if %weq d #0 then #1 else d in let g = rz-gcd-go (toNat #32) m dd in if %weq m #0 then rq (rz true #0) #1 else rq (rz s (%wdiv m g)) (%wdiv dd g)&#10;rq-add : RQ → RQ → RQ&#10;rq-add (rq n1 d1) (rq n2 d2) = rq-mk (rz-add (rz-mul n1 (rz true d2)) (rz-mul n2 (rz true d1))) (%wmul d1 d2)&#10;rq-sub : RQ → RQ → RQ&#10;rq-sub (rq n1 d1) (rq n2 d2) = rq-add (rq n1 d1) (rq (rz-neg n2) d2)&#10;rq-mul : RQ → RQ → RQ&#10;rq-mul (rq n1 d1) (rq n2 d2) = rq-mk (rz-mul n1 n2) (%wmul d1 d2)&#10;rq-div-w : RQ → Word → RQ&#10;rq-div-w (rq n d) k = rq-mk n (%wmul d (if %weq k #0 then #1 else k))&#10;rq-eq : RQ → RQ → Bool&#10;rq-eq (rq n1 d1) (rq n2 d2) = rz-eq (rz-mul n1 (rz true d2)) (rz-mul n2 (rz true d1))&#10;rq-pos : RQ → Bool&#10;rq-pos (rq (rz s m) _) = andB s (%wlt #0 m)&#10;binom-go : Nat → Word → Word → Word → Word&#10;binom-go zero _ _ acc = acc&#10;binom-go (suc rem) n i acc = binom-go rem n (%wsucc i) (%wdiv (%wmul acc (%wsub (%wsucc n) i)) i)&#10;binom : Word → Word → Word&#10;binom n k = if %wlt n k then #0 else binom-go (toNat k) n #1 #1&#10;rq-nth : (List RQ) → Nat → RQ&#10;rq-nth nil _ = rq (rz true #0) #1&#10;rq-nth (cons x _) zero = x&#10;rq-nth (cons _ xs) (suc k) = rq-nth xs k&#10;rq-append : (List RQ) → (List RQ) → List RQ&#10;rq-append nil ys = ys&#10;rq-append (cons x xs) ys = cons x (rq-append xs ys)&#10;bern-sum : (List RQ) → Word → Word → Nat → RQ → RQ&#10;bern-sum _ _ _ zero acc = acc&#10;bern-sum bs m1 j (suc rem) acc = bern-sum bs m1 (%wsucc j) rem (rq-add acc (rq-mul (rq (rz true (binom m1 j)) #1) (rq-nth bs (toNat j))))&#10;bern-go : Nat → Word → (List RQ) → List RQ&#10;bern-go zero _ bs = bs&#10;bern-go (suc rem) m bs = let m1 = %wsucc m in let bm = rq-div-w (rq-sub (rq (rz true #0) #1) (bern-sum bs m1 #0 (toNat m) (rq (rz true #0) #1))) m1 in bern-go rem m1 (rq-append bs (cons bm nil))&#10;series-neg : Word → RQ&#10;series-neg n = if %weq n #0 then rq (rz false #1) #2 else let m1 = %wsucc n in rq-div-w (rq-sub (rq (rz true #0) #1) (rq-nth (bern-go (toNat m1) #1 (cons (rq (rz true #1) #1) nil)) (toNat m1))) m1&#10;thm-continuation-trivial-zeros : andB (rq-eq (series-neg #0) (rq (rz false #1) #2)) (andB (rq-eq (series-neg #1) (rq (rz false #1) #12)) (andB (rq-eq (series-neg #2) (rq (rz true #0) #1)) (andB (rq-eq (series-neg #3) (rq (rz true #1) #120)) (rq-eq (series-neg #4) (rq (rz true #0) #1))))) ≡ true&#10;thm-continuation-trivial-zeros = refl</textarea>" (
